id: projectile-materialization
name: Projectile Materialization
advancement: true
prerequisite: Insight Score 4+
tpCost: 2
projectile: true
source: Core Rule
text: >
  Projectile Materialization: You can materialize items at a short distance, directly in the hands or on
  the person of an ally.
  –Prerequisites: Insight Score 4+
  –TP Cost: 2
  –Effect: Target a willing Ally within a Sphere AoE (centered on you). If you succeed on the Skill Check
  for Magical Materialization to create an Accessory, Apparel, or Weapon, the targeted Ally gains that
  item. If it was a piece of Apparel or an Accessory, they may replace one layer of Apparel or Accessory
  they are currently wearing, or equip it as an additional item (they decide).

---

# Offered when it is used: the Item goes to the Ally targeted. An Accessory is given to them; Apparel and
# Weapons are said on the card (the user's ruling), and so is what they do with what they wear.
